From: chasey-dev <ellenyoung0912@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] nl80211: Accept mtwifi UCI radio sections

The nl80211 PHY lookup filters UCI radio sections by mac80211 type.
Also accept mtwifi sections so their path, MAC address or PHY name can
identify an existing PHY when no matching netdev is available.

Signed-off-by: chasey-dev <ellenyoung0912@gmail.com>
--- a/iwinfo_nl80211.c
+++ b/iwinfo_nl80211.c
@@ -414,6 +414,8 @@ static int nl80211_phy_idx_from_uci(cons
 
 	s = iwinfo_uci_get_radio(name, "mac80211");
 	if (!s)
+		s = iwinfo_uci_get_radio(name, "mtwifi");
+	if (!s)
 		goto out;
 
 	opt = uci_lookup_option_string(uci_ctx, s, "path");
